1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,342
¡Mira nomás

2
00:00:01,342 --> 00:00:03,050
qué esponjositos!

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,176
¡Hoy hacemos panqueques

4
00:00:05,176 --> 00:00:05,750
de plátano!

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:06,919
Necesitas un plátano

6
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:07,560
bien maduro,

7
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,010
dos huevitos,

8
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:09,908
y media taza

9
00:00:09,908 --> 00:00:10,460
de avena.

10
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,540
¡Primero machacamos

11
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,160
el plátano!

12
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,389
Luego agregamos

13
00:00:13,389 --> 00:00:14,360
los huevitos.

14
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,060
Después, la avena.

15
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,347
¡Y mezclamos,

16
00:00:17,347 --> 00:00:18,990
mezclamos, mezclamos!

17
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,070
Ahora, al sartén

18
00:00:20,070 --> 00:00:21,000
con mantequillita.

19
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,023
Cuando salgan

20
00:00:22,023 --> 00:00:23,380
burbujitas, ¡volteamos!

21
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,365
Y al final,

22
00:00:24,365 --> 00:00:25,385
¡miel y canela!

23
00:00:25,385 --> 00:00:26,080
¡Qué rico!

24
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,508
¡Comenta qué receta

25
00:00:27,508 --> 00:00:28,294
quieres que

26
00:00:28,294 --> 00:00:29,080
haga Michi!
